<title>USA: Universal Self Care extends program.</title>
<headline>Universal Self Care extends program.</headline>
<dateline>LIVONIA, Mich. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Self Care Inc's Healthcare Management Solutions Inc subsidiary said Monday it has signed a three-year extension to administer Black &amp; Decker Corp's employee diabetes management program.</p>
<p>The deal was expected to generate $2.4 million in revenue for Healthcare Management Solutions during the next three years, the company said.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
